        <!-- Topology / routing footer note -->
        <mxCell id="topo_note" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Topology&lt;/b&gt; (2×2 mesh shown) wired by scripts in &lt;i&gt;configs/topologies/*.py&lt;/i&gt; via makeExtInLink / makeExtOutLink / makeInternalLink. &amp;nbsp;Each router owns 4 mesh ports + 1 &quot;Local&quot; port for its NI. &amp;nbsp;VNETs (e.g. CHI: REQ=0, SNP=1, RSP=2, DAT=3) are deadlock-isolated: each has its own VC pool per port.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=10;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
